{"sessionId":"L1-S08","number":8,"sessionTitle":"Oops! Fixing Bugs","title":"The Sneeze Bug","titleCard":{"text":"Episode 8. The Sneeze Bug.","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S08/title.ogg","dur":2.528,"env":"000sq22hzlvsjwstsucijxwwvwub0ic20000000000khij89wrpqpjde00zzwtsqqj4030000000","words":[["Episode",0.1,0.83],["8.",0.83,1.04],["The",1.41,1.65],["Sneeze",1.65,2.05],["Bug.",2.05,2.29]],"voice":"narrator"},"previously":{"text":"The robot planned a path through the market. Bolt sneezed and mixed up the program…","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S08/prev.ogg","dur":6.567,"env":"000nyzyvtnbkmb5e00cheovvutssvsrrh20000000000huvzzzzo2wsk4b089ywtuuwtyro2clvzzxum4478nzo7zzyzzyxo80eoona09300000000000000lzzxn9fjjknmazzywvurrsgj8duutn933zvpa2jnbezxf000f908czzzt4bbutqpopqd200000000","words":[["Last",0.11,0.6],["time...",0.6,1.1],["The",1.48,1.67],["robot",1.67,1.94],["planned",1.94,2.3],["a",2.3,2.41],["path",2.41,2.64],["through",2.64,3.0],["the",3.0,3.19],["market.",3.19,3.5],["Bolt",4.02,4.32],["sneezed",4.32,4.78],["and",4.78,5.02],["mixed",5.02,5.37],["up",5.37,5.56],["the",5.56,5.81],["program…",5.81,6.27]],"voice":"narrator"},"scenes":[{"setting":"Ms Mei’s stall. Spark gathers the jumbled program cards.","action":"Spark puts the cards back in order — or thinks so — and the robot runs them. It turns the wrong way and rolls towards the pot stall.","seconds":35,"lines":[{"i":0,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"All fixed! Go, robot!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S08/0.ogg","dur":2.242,"env":"04zvtssj79976tvte526ksl2a000000002uzzywym6744ospok55qnf7400f50000000","words":[["All",0.07,0.39],["fixed!",0.39,0.85],["Go,",1.12,1.44],["robot!",1.44,2.03]],"voice":"spark"},{"i":1,"who":"amara","guestName":null,"text":"Stop! It’s going the wrong way!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S08/1.ogg","dur":2.723,"env":"00000002fhigmwzxh302000000000000000000000ozi4i0azzyyxztrvzzzztwtrsqprqqj4000000000","words":[["Stop!",0.1,0.67],["It’s",1.39,1.57],["going",1.57,1.85],["the",1.85,2.03],["wrong",2.03,2.31],["way!",2.31,2.49]],"voice":"amara"},{"i":2,"who":"myrobot","guestName":null,"text":"Oops!","direction":"Face screen shows a wobbly mouth.","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S08/2.ogg","dur":0.597,"env":"009vzm52cc62000000","words":[["Oops!",0.1,0.38]],"voice":"myrobot"}]},{"setting":"Nana Lucía sits on a crate with a cup of tea.","action":"She tells a story. A little picture shows an old room-sized computer and a small moth.","seconds":40,"lines":[{"i":3,"who":"lucia","guestName":null,"text":"Engineers have called mistakes \"bugs\" for a very long time. Once, they found a REAL moth stuck in a giant computer!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S08/3.ogg","dur":8.12,"env":"00brrsktpornrsrsustqsqnoxk9sc30ebddtrrqpc85mpoivvp4gqqlk66nuh000tssqoi47lsgeefkrqmh99guttrtvuwsuturstrqpo7m77lpppnppnmmjh700000000000000jpwzvusvispm3lywu9433aqqqqwiutoppwzwwywttsvvvtrrn3jqsoqcbvsra2gruvwse5nrqporoi3afezxs2jeboyyyckwsqrqoa000000","words":[["Engineers",0.1,0.77],["have",0.77,1.12],["called",1.12,1.59],["mistakes",1.59,2.2],["\"bugs\"",2.2,2.55],["for",2.55,2.83],["a",2.83,2.99],["very",2.99,3.34],["long",3.34,3.69],["time.",3.69,4.04],["Once,",4.56,4.87],["they",4.87,5.18],["found",5.18,5.54],["a",5.54,5.68],["REAL",5.68,5.99],["moth",5.99,6.3],["stuck",6.3,6.67],["in",6.67,6.87],["a",6.87,7.01],["giant",7.01,7.38],["computer!",7.38,7.91]],"voice":"lucia"},{"i":4,"who":"lucia","guestName":null,"text":"They taped it in their notebook as \"the first real bug\" — a joke! Any mistake in a program is a bug. Every engineer makes them. Me too!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S08/4.ogg","dur":9.974,"env":"","words":[["They",0.1,0.38],["taped",0.38,0.72],["it",0.72,0.9],["in",0.9,1.08],["their",1.08,1.41],["notebook",1.41,1.89],["as",1.89,2.07],["\"the",2.07,2.3],["first",2.3,2.64],["real",2.64,2.92],["bug\"",2.92,3.15],["—",3.15,3.23],["a",3.23,3.35],["joke!",3.35,3.64],["Any",4.13,4.37],["mistake",4.37,4.82],["in",4.82,5.01],["a",5.01,5.14],["pro